          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive a confirmation email containing your tracking details, allowing you to monitor the progress of your delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_GKV8Dy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I return an item?",
            "answer": "<p>If you wish to return an item, you may do so within 30 days of receipt, provided it is unworn, unwashed and in its original condition.</p><p>To begin the process, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\" title=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\"><strong>info@bennettandclarke.co.uk</strong></a><strong> </strong>. Our team will guide you through the next steps.</p><p>Further details can be found in our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Refund Policy</a><em><strong>.</strong></em></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3446XN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I contact Customer Service?",
            "answer": "<p>If you require any assistance, our Customer Care team will be pleased to help.<br/><br/>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\" title=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\"><strong>info@bennettandclarke.co.uk<br/></strong></a>Telephone: +44 20 8073 1447</p><p><br/>Customer Care Hours:<br/>Monday to Friday | 9:00AM – 6:00PM<br/>Weekends | Closed<br/><br/>Alternatively, you may use our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">contact form</a> and we will respond as promptly as possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_NeAD3a": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the correct size?",
            "answer": "<p>A detailed size guide is available on almost each product page to help you select the most suitable fit.</p><p>If you require further advice, our Customer Care team will be happy to assist you at <a href=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\" title=\"mailto:info@bennettandclarke.co.uk\"><strong>info@bennettandclarke.co.uk</strong></a> .</p>"
          }
